/**
 * Wedding App backend - Google Apps Script (free).
 *
 * Setup:
 *  1. Create a Google Sheet (personal account) -> Extensions -> Apps Script.
 *  2. Paste this file as Code.gs and save.
 *  3. Run `setup` once (authorize). It creates all tabs, default settings,
 *     Drive folders and a default admin passcode.
 *  4. Project Settings -> Script Properties -> change ADMIN_PASSCODE.
 *  5. Deploy -> New deployment -> Web app -> Execute as: Me, Access: Anyone.
 *  6. Copy the /exec URL into js/config.js (API_URL).
 */

